{"capturado_en": "2026-11-11T23:42:24+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swag and Sorcery", "steam_appid": 929010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Consider Kill It With Fire</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/d9fda57f31f6b06c8c05e741a1769eb3.poster.avif?t=1775826402\" width=614 height=610 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/d9fda57f31f6b06c8c05e741a1769eb3.webm?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/d9fda57f31f6b06c8c05e741a1769eb3.mp4?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to Swag and Sorcery, a new streamlined RPG from the creators of Punch Club and Graveyard Keeper! Build your own fantasy village, train and equip your heroes and send them out to collect Swag!<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Equip your heroes<br></li><li>Send them out to fights (up to 3 parties at a time), and closely monitor the swag they get by progressing through levels<br></li><li>Pull them out of combat if they're about to die (otherwise they lose their loot)<br></li><li>Upgrade the heroes in your village and Repeat</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/97d34f8d38309dbeed5928779693ed4f.poster.avif?t=1775826402\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/97d34f8d38309dbeed5928779693ed4f.webm?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/97d34f8d38309dbeed5928779693ed4f.mp4?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Story</strong><br><br>Embark on an epic quest to retrieve the king's missing... suit. He really loves it. Wants it back. Let's put all the heroes into mortal danger for this important mission!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/0ceb373e8529123ae70b128ecdd7e82a.poster.avif?t=1775826402\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/0ceb373e8529123ae70b128ecdd7e82a.webm?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/0ceb373e8529123ae70b128ecdd7e82a.mp4?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>At its core Swag and Sorcery is an epic, ruthless adventure that both RPG and idle game fans will appreciate. There's also a sarcastic cat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/9e651b401e95967b292a1e130d58b772.poster.avif?t=1775826402\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/9e651b401e95967b292a1e130d58b772.webm?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/9e651b401e95967b292a1e130d58b772.mp4?t=1775826402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/929010/extras/d9fda57f31f6b06c8c05e741a1769eb3.poster.avif?t=1775826402\" width=614 height=610 ><source src=\"htt